{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026baZtFJwlds1792968932.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>高鑫零售發盈警，料截至九月底止半年虧損將按年擴大最少三倍，蝕5億至5.5億元人民幣，主要因客流受市場競爭分流影響有所回落，引致收入下行、商品及供應鏈調整、門店及商店街調改尚處於轉型調整階段等。</p><p></p><p>期內經調整EBITDA料最多為10.5億元人民幣。經營活動所得現金淨額最多18億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T06:20:46.679560+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T22:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T06:18:10.794673+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T06:18:10.794673+00:00","content_hash":"fefb45bdfb15e075d9a28a6315bf5406cc7a6e1993ab9712e266cb5d95d568f8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}